<!--
  Entitlements for the code-signed XPC shim the TS daemon spawns.

  Minimal: a Developer-ID client connecting to a LaunchDaemon mach service needs
  no special entitlement. Hardened runtime is applied via
  `codesign --options runtime`. The shim's designated identifier
  (ai.sanctuaryprotocol.macos.castle-wall.signer-client) is pinned at sign time
  via `codesign --identifier`, which the helper's caller requirement checks.
-->
